THIRD-PARTY DATA AND TERMS

This software queries third-party APIs. Operators are responsible for
complying with each provider's terms:

- Steam Web API: https://steamcommunity.com/dev/apiterms
- FACEIT Data API: https://developers.faceit.com/terms
- Leetify API: https://leetify.com/blog/leetify-api-developer-guidelines/
  (display the "Data Provided by Leetify" attribution when using Leetify data;
   never modify Leetify logos)

THIRD-PARTY ASSETS AND TRADEMARKS

The repository bundles artwork and trademarks owned by third parties for
interoperability and identification only. This project is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any of them:

- Counter-Strike 2, its map artwork (icons, radar-derived thumbnails),
  Premier rating banners, and the CT/T faction icons are property of
  Valve Corporation. Map art in apps/web/public/maps is derived from
  community depot mirrors (MurkyYT/cs2-map-icons) and the banner bases
  from community game-file extracts (Juknum/counter-strike-icons).
- The FACEIT name, logo, and skill level badges are property of FACEIT
  Ltd. Level badges in apps/web/public/logos/faceit-levels are sourced
  from FACEIT's CDN.
- The Leetify name and logos are property of Leetify AB. Marks in
  apps/web/public/logos are sourced from leetify.com and are used under
  their published API attribution guidelines.
- The Steam name and logo are property of Valve Corporation.
- Country flags in apps/web/public/flags are from flagcdn.com (public
  domain).

If you are a rights holder and believe an asset is used incorrectly,
please open an issue and it will be addressed promptly.

USAGE NOTES

- Vantage computes an automated "threat score" from public data. It is a
  heuristic opinion, not a VAC verdict or proof of cheating. Do not
  present it as one.
- Only publicly accessible profile data is queried. Respect the rate
  limits of every upstream provider.
